## Project Structure

```
├── index.html          # Main feed / friends landing page
├── profiles/            # Individual fictional profile pages
│   └── jessica-b-taylor/
├── assets/              # Images, icons, logos, and other static assets
├── LICENSE
└── README.md
```

## Getting Started

Clone the repo and open `index.html` in your browser — no build step or dependencies required.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/hexL3t/fakebook.git
cd fakebook
open index.html
```

## Disclaimer

Fakebook profiles are entirely fictional entities created for OSINT training purposes. They are not affiliated with Meta Platforms, Inc. or any real-world company. All names, logos, and content are used in parody.

